  "mainHtml": "<main>\n\n                                 <article id=\"main-content\" class=\"article main-content container-fluid\" role=\"article\">\n          \n                                                                <header class=\"row content-header\">\n                         <section id=\"block-entityviewcontent-7\" data-block-plugin-id=\"entity_view:node\" class=\"block block-ctools block-entity-viewnode clearfix\">\n  \n    \n\n      \n<div class=\"col-sm-12 col-md-8 col-md-offset-2\">\n\n          <p class=\"content-type-label text-center\">COMPANY ANNOUNCEMENT</p>\n    \n  \n  \n  <h1 class=\"content-title text-center\">Snack Right Super Foods, Inc. dba Brad&#039;s Raw Chips Recalls Brad&#039;s Crunchy Kale &amp; Veggie Chips Due to Potential Thallium Contamination</h1>\n\n  \n    \n        <div class=\"alert alert-danger text-center col-xs-12\" id=\"disclaimer\">\n      <p>When a company announces a recall, market withdrawal, or safety alert, the FDA posts the company's announcement as a public service. FDA does not endorse either the product or the company.</p>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-default\" href=\"#recall-announcement\">Read Announcement</a> <a class=\"btn btn-default\" href=\"#recall-photos\">View Product Photos</a> \n    </div>\n  \n  \n \n</div>\n \n  </section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                      </header>\n                              \n                                                          \n                              <aside class=\"col-md-2\" role=\"complementary\">\n                  <section id=\"block-entityviewcontent-3\" data-block-plugin-id=\"entity_view:node\" class=\"block block-ctools block-entity-viewnode clearfix\">\n  \n    \n\n        <div class=\"region region-\">\n    <p class=\"text-center \"><a href=\"/safety/recalls-market-withdrawals-safety-alerts\" class=\"btn btn-default\"><i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-left\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> More Recalls, Market <br>\n    Withdrawals, & <br>\n    Safety Alerts</a></p>\n\n        <nav id=\"section-nav\"class=\"lcds-card lcds-section-nav lcds-section-nav--side hidden-xs hidden-sm\">\n      <ul class=\"lcds-section-nav__list lcds-section-nav--side__list\">\n        <li>\n\n                    <a href=\"/safety/recalls-market-withdrawals-safety-alerts\" title=\"Recalls, Market Withdrawals, &amp; Safety Alerts\" class=\"lcds-section-nav__link lcds-section-nav--side__link lcds-section-nav__parent-link lcds-section-nav--side__parent-link\">\n                                        Recalls, Market Withdrawals, &amp; Safety Alerts\n                      </a>\n\n          \n                        <div class=\"views-element-container form-group\"><div class=\"view view-in-this-section view-id-in_this_section view-display-id-block_4 js-view-dom-id-20e1f5f7843fd108cad2664105606afda187cfafb78f7c60886e8c3a3eb5b3f4\">\n  \n    \n      \n  \n      <div class=\"item-list\">\n  \n  <ul class=\"lcds-section-nav__active lcds-section-nav__list lcds-section-nav--side__list\">\n\n          <li><a href=\"/safety/recalls-market-withdrawals-safety-alerts/recall-resources\" class=\"lcds-section-nav__link lcds-section-nav--side__link\">Recall Resources </a></li>\n    \n  </ul>\n\n</div>\n\n\n  \n          </div>\n</div>\n\n\n                        <div class=\"views-element-container form-group\"><div class=\"view view-in-this-section-sub view-id-in_this_section_sub view-display-id-block_1 js-view-dom-id-66eacd55a795e45f9b79dbbbbe7f7113cb444ba4d5b75ed09e37a2580c544181\">\n  \n    \n      \n      <div class=\"view-content\">\n      <div>\n  \n  <ul class=\"lcds-section-nav__list\">\n\n          <li><a href=\"/safety/recalls-market-withdrawals-safety-alerts/enforcement-reports\" class=\"lcds-section-nav__section-link lcds-section-nav__link lcds-section-nav--side__link\">Enforcement Reports</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/safety/recalls-market-withdrawals-safety-alerts/industry-guidance-recalls\" class=\"lcds-section-nav__section-link lcds-section-nav__link lcds-section-nav--side__link\">Industry Guidance For Recalls</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/safety/recalls-market-withdrawals-safety-alerts/major-product-recalls\" class=\"lcds-section-nav__section-link lcds-section-nav__link lcds-section-nav--side__link\">Major Product Recalls</a></li>\n    \n  </ul>\n\n</div>\n\n    </div>\n  \n          </div>\n</div>\n\n\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </nav>\n  </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n\n                </aside>\n              \n                                                          \n              <div class=\"col-md-8\" role=\"main\">\n\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                                              \n  <h2>Summary</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"inset-column\">\n    <dl class=\"lcds-description-list--grid\">\n            <dt class=\"cell-1_1\">Company Announcement Date:</dt>\n             <dd class=\"cell-2_1\"><time datetime=\"2026-11-02T17:19:00Z\">November 02, 2026</time>\n</dd>\n\n                          <dt class=\"cell-1_2\">FDA Publish Date:</dt> \n               <dd class=\"cell-2_2\"><time datetime=\"2026-11-03T05:00:00Z\">November 03, 2026</time>\n</dd>\n                                    <dt class=\"cell-1_3\">Product Type:</dt> \n              <dd class=\"cell-2_3\">Food &amp; Beverages                          \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n             \n            \n            \n            \n              \n            \n            \n                          </dd>\n                          <dt class=\"cell-1_4\">Reason for Announcement:</dt>\n              <dd class=\"cell-2_4\">\n  <div class=\"field field--name-field-recall-reason-description field--type-string field--label-above\">\n    <div class=\"field--label\">Recall Reason Description</div>\n              <div class=\"field--item\">Product may contain thallium.</div>\n          </div>\n</dd>\n\n            <dt class=\"cell-1_5\">Company Name:</dt> \n              <dd class=\"cell-2_5\">Snack Right Super Foods dba Brad’s Raw Chips</dd>\n\n            <dt class=\"cell-1_6\">Brand Name:</dt>\n              <dd class=\"cell-2_6\">\n  <div class=\"field field--name-field-brand-name field--type-entity-reference field--label-inline\">\n    <div class=\"field--label\">Brand Name(s)</div>\n          <div class=\"field--items\">\n              <div class=\"field--item\">Brad’s </div>\n              </div>\n      </div>\n</dd>\n\n            <dt class=\"cell-1_7\">Product Description:</dt>\n              <dd class=\"cell-2_7\">\n  <div class=\"field field--name-field-product-description field--type-string field--label-above\">\n    <div class=\"field--label\">Product Description</div>\n          <div class=\"field--items\">\n              <div class=\"field--item\">Crunchy Kale and Veggie Chips Kale</div>\n              </div>\n      </div>\n</dd> \n        </dl>\n      </div>   \n<hr>\n\n  <h2 id=\"recall-announcement\">Company Announcement</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Coral Gables, FL</strong> - Snack Right Super Foods, Inc., doing business as Brad's Raw Chips, is recalling certain Brad's Plant Based Crunchy Kale (2 oz) and Brad's Veggie Chips Kale (3 oz) products because they may contain thallium.</p><p>Thallium (Tl) is a naturally occurring metal found in the soil and in sulfur-based minerals. It can be taken up by plants and vegetables, particularly those in the Brassicaceous family (i.e., cabbage, radish). Acute or chronic exposure to thallium at relatively high levels can result in serious adverse health effects, including gastroenteritis, damage to peripheral nerves, and alopecia (hair loss).</p><p>The products were distributed nationwide through KeHE Distributors and United Natural Foods, Inc. (UNFI), and sold directly to five individual consumers. Approximately 25,000 bags (about 2,097 cases) of the recalled products are estimated to be in commerce. Distribution occurred between October 2025 and December 2025.</p><p>The recall includes the following Brad's Plant Based products, all in bags, distributed under the brand name Brad's Plant Based, with the lot numbers and Best By dates listed below:</p><ul><li>Brad's Crunchy Kale, Original, 2 oz (57g) bag, UPC 813104021679, Lots 33525-1, 33525-2 and 33525-3 (Best By February 1, 2027), Lot 34525-1 (Best By February 11, 2027) and Lot 35125-2 (Best By February 17, 2027)</li><li>Brad's Crunchy Kale, Cheeze It Up, 2 oz (57g) bag, UPC 813104021877, Lot 35025-3 (Best By February 16, 2027)</li><li>Brad's Crunchy Kale, Radical Ranch, 2 oz (57g) bag, UPC 813104020726, Lot 29425-1 (Best By December 21, 2026)</li><li>Brad's Veggie Chips Kale, 3 oz (85g) bag, UPC 854615002054, Lot 33225-3 (Best By January 28, 2027), Lot 33325-2 (Best By January 29, 2027), Lot 33425-1 (Best By January 30, 2027) and Lot 33525-1 (Best By February 1, 2027)</li></ul><p>In May 2026, the California Department of Public Health (CDPH) advised consumers not to eat certain Brad's Plant Based products after it investigated an inquiry from one individual with elevated thallium levels. CDPH collected samples at retail stores in the Sacramento area, and laboratory testing found elevated thallium levels in multiple varieties. The recall was initiated after the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) advised the firm of thallium in tested products. Brassica crops such as kale are known to accumulate certain elements from soil. The manufacturing process did not introduce the contaminant; however, the dehydration process removes approximately 85 to 90 percent of the product's water, which concentrates elements already present in the fresh kale.</p><p>Consumers who have purchased any of the products listed above should stop consuming them immediately and discard the product. Refunds are not being offered, and the product should not be returned to the place of purchase.</p><p>Consumers with questions may contact Alexa Olvera at Snack Right Super Foods, Inc. by email at <a href=\"mailto:alexandra@thesnackright.com\">alexandra@thesnackright.com</a>, Monday through Friday, 10:00 a.m. to 4:00 p.m. Eastern Time. Consumers can expect a response within one business day.</p><p>Consumers who believe they may have experienced adverse health effects from consumption of these products should contact their health care provider.</p><p>This voluntary recall is being conducted with the knowledge of the U.S. Food and Drug Administration.</p>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"inset-column\">\n      <hr>\n    <h2>Company Contact Information</h2>\n  \n  \n    <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6\">\n      <dl>\n          <dt>Consumers:</dt>       \n\n                 <dd>Alexa Olvera, Snack Right Super Foods, Inc.</dd>\n        \n        \n                 <dd><span class=\"fa fa-envelope\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><a href=\"mailto:alexandra@thesnackright.com\"> alexandra@thesnackright.com</a></dd>\n        \n        \n\n      </dl>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6\">\n      <dl>\n\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      </dl>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n\n\n\n  <hr>\n  <div id=\"recall-photos\" class=\"recall-photos lazy-load\">\n    <h2>Product Photos</h2>\n\n            <ul class=\"list-unstyled nav-stacked\">\n        \n    <li>\n    \t<figure>\n    \t\t<div>\n  \n  \n            <div class=\"field field--name-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field--item\">    <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/files/styles/recall_image_small/public/rev_image_2_8.png?itok=1OkLZLGK 229w\" media=\"all and (max-width: 320px)\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"100vw\" width=\"229\" height=\"306\"/>\n              <source srcset=\"/files/styles/recall_image_small/public/rev_image_2_8.png?itok=1OkLZLGK 229w\" media=\"all and (min-width: 321px) and (max-width: 480px)\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"100vw\" width=\"229\" height=\"306\"/>\n              <s